WEBVTT

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:02.520
Astral!

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:07.150
Where are you, Astral?

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:08.190
You won’t go any further!

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:11.560
Help me, my brothers!

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:13.150
Orbital 5 and 6!

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.030
Click!

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:18.830
What’s that?

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:31.590
It doesn’t look like
they’re welcoming us.

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:52.190
Yuma, go!

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:56.700
We’ll handle things
here, so keep going!

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:58.660
But...

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:07.470
Cattabing, class representative!

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:10.210
Yuma, keep going!

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:11.920
Stay strong, Yuma!

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:13.730
Everyone...

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:24.510
To summarize, we won’t
let you catch us!

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:25.890
Over here!

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:38.090
Your LP are half of mine.

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:40.530
What will you do?

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:43.790
I set one card and end my turn.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.130
What’s wrong?

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:51.980
Are you already stuck?

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:55.180
My turn! I draw!

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:57.910
Defense doesn’t work against Kaito.

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:00.390
Yuma, what would you do?

00:02:05.410 --> 00:02:06.970
Damn!

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:09.340
Open!

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:14.710
Hurry!

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:27.720
Those punks! I’ll have to...

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:31.750
What’s wrong? It’s your turn.

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:34.590
I know the answer.

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:37.220
It’s kattobing, Yuma!

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:40.160
I summon Zubaba Knight!

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:48.850
I discard one card from
my hand to the graveyard.

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:51.480
I Special Summon Acorno!

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:57.820
I activate the spell
card Drop Exchange!

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:02.280
I send at least two monsters on my
field to the graveyard

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:07.160
to Special Summon a monster from my hand
whose Level equals their total.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:12.580
I send Level 3 Zubaba Knight and
Level 1 Acorno to the graveyard.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:15.500
I Special Summon Kagetokage!

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.240
This monster can’t
be Normal Summoned.

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:21.090
It can only be Special
Summoned from my hand.

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:24.050
Two Level 4 monsters.

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:28.250
I overlay Gogogo Golem
and Kagetokage!

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:34.380
With these two monsters,
I build the Overlay Network!

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:36.230
Xyz Summon!

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:42.160
Appear, Number 39: Utopia!

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:51.620
Just wait, Astral!
I promise to rescue you!

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:56.040
That’s Kaito.

00:03:57.180 --> 00:03:59.970
Who’s the other one?

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.610
This is...

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:19.070
Let’s continue our agreement.

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:20.690
Agreement?

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:25.510
The one who opens this
door gains new power.

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:31.290
But as compensation, he will lose
what’s most important to him.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:34.540
But there’s someone interfering
with our agreement.

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:39.380
Use your power to eliminate him.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:44.400
Jump into this door and
acquire the power of ZEXAL.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:47.050
That is, if you’re
prepared to do so.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.710
ZEXAL?

00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:58.770
Whether it’s rain, wind,
blizzard or the scorching sun

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:01.900
They give color to each day;
Will and love keep me from losing heart

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.700
Your kindness was harsh;
I learned frustration when we clashed

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:09.080
Freedom begins by accepting differences;
Dance and create the universe

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:16.450
In truth, I was sad
until I met you

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:22.920
I lied, thinking it was
easier to be alone

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:29.550
Even though we don’t like
the same books or hobbies

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:33.430
You’re the only one
who agreed with me

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:36.560
Joy and sadness and anger
and do re mi fa so la ti do

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:38.350
There’s no harmony and scenario
without differences

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:41.730
Everyone is not the same

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:46.650
That’s the reason for living

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:51.910
Even if the sounds
are dissonant at times

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:57.330
That’s why I never give up;
I believe my strength will get me through

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:00.590
I travel to
the edge of the world

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:05.050
The sights I see
with you are the truth

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.880
Whether it’s rain, wind,
blizzard or the scorching sun

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:11.140
They give color to each day;
Will and love keep me from losing heart

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:14.520
Your kindness was harsh;
I learned frustration when we clashed

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:18.190
Freedom begins by accepting differences;
Dance and create the universe

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:27.320
\hXyz Summon of Souls! ZEXAL\h

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:27.320
Number 24:

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.480
The Number appeared.

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:30.110
Go, Utopia! Attack Photon Leo!

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:32.410
Hope Sword Slash!

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:46.590
I know what you’re planning.

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:49.800
I activate the trap Armored Back!

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:53.850
When a monster equipped with
an Equip Spell is destroyed,

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:58.180
I can resurrect it in its
pre-destruction stage!

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:00.600
Resurrect, Photon Leo!

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:12.450
He resurrected Photon Leo.

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:16.150
You need to tribute two
monsters with at least 2000 ATK

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:18.910
to summon Galaxy-Eyes.

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:20.670
It’s coming!

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:24.380
I set one card and end my turn!

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.190
ZEXAL?

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:30.220
I won’t forgive you!

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:32.640
It’s all over for you!

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:35.300
Give up!

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:37.770
Aren’t you...

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:42.350
I’m Orbital 7!

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:50.320
Scrap!

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.600
I’ll turn you into scrap!

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:57.240
It’s my turn.

00:07:57.710 --> 00:08:00.040
I attack you directly!

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.330
I’m stuck!

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.750
It’s your turn for awhile.

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:09.090
Please pull me out!

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:14.970
My turn! I draw!

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:19.520
I summon Photon Circle.

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:26.840
Photon Circle has
1000 ATK.

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:29.630
You can’t use it to Special
Summon Galaxy-Eyes.

00:08:29.630 --> 00:08:31.490
We’ll see about that.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:33.740
I activate the effect
of Photon Spear

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:36.250
that’s equipped
on to Photon Leo.

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:42.790
When I tribute a monster equipped with Photon Spear to Special Summon, it counts as two monsters.

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:43.620
What?

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:46.710
I’ll show you my spirit!

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:57.470
The embodiment of light descends!
Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:03.060
Galaxy-Eyes Photon
Dragon finally appeared!

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:06.640
Galaxy-Eyes, attack Utopia!

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:10.190
Photon Stream of Destruction!

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:13.390
Galaxy-Eyes’s effect activates!

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:17.570
When Galaxy-Eyes battles,
both monsters are banished.

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:21.410
Now your field is wide open!

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:23.910
Go, Photon Circle!

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:26.620
Attack him directly!

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:27.880
Photon!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:36.050
When the battle is over, Galaxy-Eyes
and Utopia return to the field.

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:44.680
Due to Galaxy-Eyes’s effect,
it absorbs Utopia’s Overlay Units!

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:51.880
Galaxy-Eyes gains 500 ATK
for every Overlay Unit it absorbs!

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:54.200
4000 ATK!

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:58.490
I activate the Quick-Play Spell
Galaxy Storm from my hand!

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:04.650
This card destroys an Xyz
Monster with no Overlay Units!

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:05.910
Vanish, Utopia!

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:09.420
I activate the trap Xyz Reflect!

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:18.340
This card negates an effect that would destroy an Xyz Monster, and you take 800 points of damage!

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:19.760
What?

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:26.530
Not bad, but I can
withstand this damage.

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:31.540
Did you forget that Utopia is
powerless against Galaxy-Eyes?

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:35.570
My kattobing isn’t over yet!

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:38.280
My turn! I draw!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:41.990
I’ll show you Utopia’s true form!

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:44.990
When I have less than 1000 LP,

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:49.140
I can use Utopia as material
to Chaos Xyz Change!

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:57.400
Appear, Number C39!

00:10:57.400 --> 00:11:00.090
The power of hope! The envoy
that changes chaos into light!

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:03.330
Utopia Ray!

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:12.770
No way! A Chaos Number?

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:16.860
Numbers have this power?

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:21.820
But Galaxy-Eyes has
more ATK!

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:25.580
My target isn’t Galaxy-Eyes!

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:29.040
Utopia Ray’s effect activates!

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:34.790
By using one Overlay Unit,
Utopia Ray gains 500 ATK this turn!

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:38.230
Overlay Charge!

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:48.050
And your monster loses
1000 ATK!

00:11:48.050 --> 00:11:50.560
I choose Photon Circle.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.300
This is...

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:55.150
Go, Utopia Ray!

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:57.400
Attack Photon Circle!

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:00.900
Hope Sword Chaos Slash!

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:11.410
Did I defeat him?

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:15.450
How?

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:17.340
Too bad.

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:24.090
When you attacked and destroyed Photon Circle,
its effect cut the damage in half.

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:27.100
He survived the attack.

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:31.410
I set one card and end my turn!

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:33.560
I’ve turned the tables.

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:37.560
My turn! I draw!

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:40.280
Vanish before Galaxy-Eyes!

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:44.040
Photon Stream of Destruction!

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:49.950
I activate the trap
Clean Barrier — Clear Force!

00:12:50.430 --> 00:12:58.040
When your declare an attack, this card returns your monsters to their original ATK!

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:05.210
Galaxy-Eyes originally
has 3000 ATK.

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:09.310
Therefore, I take 500
points of damage.

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:15.560
I couldn’t finish you off.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:18.310
But you only have 400 LP left.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:22.980
Even though Utopia showed its true form,
it’s still over for you.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:26.040
Yuma...

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:34.870
The King’s Key!

00:13:39.470 --> 00:13:43.090
I can’t defeat Kaito?

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:45.800
Yuma...

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:53.250
Goodbye.

00:13:54.800 --> 00:13:56.770
What’s this?

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:02.660
The King’s Key is...

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:06.720
Astral, answer me!

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:15.160
Astral!

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:22.250
This place is...

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:25.710
Jump into the door.

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:32.680
Jump into the door and
acquire new power.

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:39.120
But as compensation, you will lose
what’s most important to you.

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:41.940
Are you willing to do that?

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:46.030
Astral!

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:50.140
Yuma...

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:51.370
Is that you, Yuma?

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:54.670
Yeah! Are you okay?

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:56.080
I know you’re in a duel!

00:14:56.950 --> 00:15:02.080
Yuma, my LP are unfortunately like
a candle in the wind.

00:15:02.570 --> 00:15:05.670
Just wait! I’m coming to you!

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:07.170
Wait, Yuma.

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:11.420
This world is different than yours.

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:14.950
This place may not be safe for you.

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:17.890
Besides, this is my fight.

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:23.310
Astral, stop carrying
the burden alone!

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:25.860
You and I are one!

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:30.280
ZEXAL!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:31.820
What?

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:36.200
The door told me to acquire
the power of ZEXAL!

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:38.930
How do you know about ZEXAL?

00:15:38.930 --> 00:15:41.750
You know about ZEXAL?

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:45.460
It’s the miraculous power
that will save my world.

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:51.490
But as compensation, you will lose
what’s most important to you.

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:54.790
I’ll acquire the power, Astral!

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:58.140
I’ll give up anything to save you!

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:02.080
I’m super kattobing!

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:10.280
Yuma...

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:12.770
I...

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:17.280
My turn!

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:25.440
Yuma and I build the
Overlay Network!

00:16:25.440 --> 00:16:31.500
When two distant souls
merge, we inherit the power!

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:32.840
Come, Yuma!

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:38.470
I’m kattobing!

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:41.430
Xyz Change ZEXAL!

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:52.440
What’s going on?

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:19.040
What’s this? Is this me?

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:21.890
And my power.

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:24.310
ZEXAL!

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:26.910
That’s Yuma Tsukumo’s voice!

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:29.820
The two of you combined?

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:33.780
But you only have 400 LP!

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:36.810
That’s all we have?

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:39.810
Let’s win, Yuma.

00:17:39.810 --> 00:17:42.200
We’ll risk everything on this draw!

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:46.210
For a powerful duelist, everything
is destined in his duel.

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:49.670
The duelist even creates
the card that he draws.

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:51.980
Concentrate, Yuma.

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:55.420
Let’s go, Astral!

00:17:55.420 --> 00:18:03.430
All the light and power, reside in my right arm
and illuminate the path of hope!

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:07.520
Shining Draw!

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:15.140
Appear, ZW...

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:20.410
Unicorn Spear!

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:24.950
Unicorn Spear equips
on to Utopia Ray,

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:29.370
and Utopia Ray gains
1900 ATK!

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:35.010
Change, Unicorn Spear!

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:41.600
Now Utopia Ray has more ATK
than Galaxy-Eyes!

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:46.560
4400 ATK?

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:49.810
When Utopia Ray is equipped
with Unicorn Spear,

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:53.770
it negates your monster’s
field-leaving effect!

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:56.490
Now Galaxy-Eyes can’t escape!

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:59.490
Go, ZEXAL Weapon!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:02.660
Unicorn Slash!

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:11.000
I activate the trap Photon Shock!

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:20.250
Due to Photon Shock, when a Photon monster takes damage in battle, both players take that damage.

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:20.970
What?

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:25.390
Galaxy-Eyes!

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:42.290
Kaito, why are you
gathering Numbers?

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:44.970
Why are you acting devilish?

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:48.410
Hey, Kaito!

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:54.040
I sold my soul to the devil
for my younger brother.

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.710
Younger brother?

00:19:57.710 --> 00:20:00.230
Was that...

00:20:00.230 --> 00:20:03.180
What happened to you?

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:06.600
I’m giving this back to you.

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:09.560
That’s Shark’s soul.

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:17.730
You’re awake.

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:19.610
I...

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:23.720
It seems Yuma was telling the truth.

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:25.190
Yuma...

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:30.910
What are you doing?

00:20:32.510 --> 00:20:34.620
This is bad!

00:20:35.680 --> 00:20:37.090
Is everyone safe?

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:38.590
What’s happening?

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:40.590
To summarize, let’s escape!

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:42.710
Yeah!

00:20:42.710 --> 00:20:44.410
What about Yuma?

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:50.640
He’s fine! Trust him!

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:54.140
Yuma!

00:20:56.050 --> 00:20:58.020
What?

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:06.200
Yuma!

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:08.010
Yuma!

00:21:20.560 --> 00:21:21.360
Yuma…

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:25.280
Yuma!

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:29.110
Yuma...

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:34.420
Hey, Kotori!

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:37.100
Sheesh, you’re not
supposed to say “Hey!”

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:38.670
You’re such a fool!

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:40.400
You’re alive, Yuma!

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:43.900
I refuse to die.

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:47.820
Yuma!

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:49.410
I’m fine.

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:00.000
Yuma Tsukumo...

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:03.890
Kaito!

00:22:15.970 --> 00:22:18.440
Yuma, there’s something
I want to ask you.

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:20.310
Why so serious?

00:22:20.870 --> 00:22:24.900
Yuma, what does the “D” on
your T-shirt stand for?

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:34.800
Today’s test is hard;
Can’t avoid pleasure and temptation

00:22:34.800 --> 00:22:40.000
I want to go home and watch TV;
Recent cartoons are entertaining

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:54.400
Anyway, tests are hard;
Language, math and English are especially hard

00:22:54.400 --> 00:22:59.600
Average scores in science and social studies;
I’m only good at P.E.

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:02.020
(Wait, Baby!) The expected

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:04.650
(What’s that, Baby!) Answers

00:23:04.650 --> 00:23:07.030
(Wait a sec, Baby!) Remember them

00:23:07.030 --> 00:23:08.950
(What are we!? Baby!) For who

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:13.560
Let’s say I wrote
the correct answers on that sheet

00:23:13.560 --> 00:23:18.160
Will that change the future a year
or a decade from now?

00:23:18.200 --> 00:23:23.500
The world I drew
at the edge of dreams

00:23:23.500 --> 00:23:28.210
Someday I’ll race in the sky

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:33.350
Nobody can threaten my heart

00:23:33.350 --> 00:23:37.070
Nothing is correct!

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:45.650
Time suddenly stopped in our world,
and three suns appeared in the sky!

00:23:45.650 --> 00:23:49.050
That sun is from my world!

00:23:49.050 --> 00:23:50.990
Is this Kaito’s doing?

00:23:50.990 --> 00:23:53.350
Thank goodness you’re safe, Astral.

00:23:53.350 --> 00:23:56.550
Someone is meddling
with my memories!

00:23:56.550 --> 00:23:58.910
What’s going on?

00:23:58.910 --> 00:24:02.080
Yuma, let’s follow the
memories of our duels.

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:10.010
\h\hThe Time Approaches — Three Suns Appear\h\h

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:07.420
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZEXAL:
“The Time Approaches — Three Suns Appear”

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:10.010
I’m kattobing!

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:12.430
The “D” on Yuma’s
T-shirt stands for...

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:13.300
Donkan (Insensitive)

00:24:13.300 --> 00:24:14.260
Doheta (Unskilled)

00:24:14.260 --> 00:24:15.240
Dosukebe (Pervert)

00:24:15.240 --> 00:24:16.090
Doaho (Idiot)

00:24:16.090 --> 00:24:17.120
Dôdemoii (Indifferent)

00:24:17.120 --> 00:24:17.810
Dokechi (Stingy)

00:24:17.810 --> 00:24:19.100
Dônimonaranai (Helpless)

00:24:19.100 --> 00:24:20.640
Dônimozannen (Unfortunate)

00:24:21.380 --> 00:24:25.020
The “D” stands for Duel, of course!
